# The build context is the repo root. Send only what docker/Dockerfile copies,
# and never a submodule: PX4-Autopilot alone is ~3 GB, and the UWB firmware's
# vendor SDK must never end up in an image.
*
!docker/
!.devcontainer/
!components/common/
!components/vehicle/
!components/localization/
!components/planning/
!components/system/

components/vehicle/PX4-Autopilot
components/vehicle/uwb_firmware
components/vehicle/tools
components/planning/MARL_cooperative_aerial_manipulation_ext
components/planning/skrl
**/README.md
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
.component_workspaces
